1
00:00:00,386 --> 00:00:02,526
(Sheldon:)Which only sits on alternate years.

2
00:00:02,688 --> 00:00:05,328
(Sheldon:)Yeah, and by the way,
it sits over there.

3
00:00:06,125 --> 00:00:07,695
(Penny:)Come on, that is ridiculous.

4
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:11,000
(Leonard:)She's right. A committee that
important should meet more often.

5
00:00:11,631 --> 00:00:12,971
(Penny:)That's not what I'm saying.

6
00:00:13,032 --> 00:00:15,842
(Leonard:)This is the thing
about me standing up to him

7
00:00:16,002 --> 00:00:17,212
(Leonard:)and not letting him run my life?

8
00:00:17,370 --> 00:00:18,540
(Howard:)Yes.

9
00:00:18,704 --> 00:00:20,184
(Raj:)That.

10
00:00:20,906 --> 00:00:23,856
(Sheldon:)Okay. I think we've
found the problem here.

11
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:25,750
(Sheldon:)It's not the table at all.

12
00:00:25,911 --> 00:00:26,981
(Penny:)It's you.

13
00:00:27,146 --> 00:00:28,246
(Penny:)Me?

14
00:00:28,414 --> 00:00:30,414
(Leonard:)It's always me,
take one for the team.

15
00:00:31,217 --> 00:00:33,557
(Sheldon:)I have spent years
turning this lump of clay

16
00:00:33,719 --> 00:00:35,829
(Sheldon:)into an acceptable conduit
for my will,

17
00:00:35,988 --> 00:00:38,398
(Sheldon:)and then you came along
and reshaped him,

18
00:00:38,557 --> 00:00:41,727
(Sheldon:)with your newfangled ideas
and your fancy genitals.

19
00:00:43,229 --> 00:00:45,109
(Penny:)Are you gonna let him
talk to me like this?

20
00:00:45,231 --> 00:00:47,371
"Fancy" sounds like a compliment.

21
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,880
(Penny:)Okay, I have not tried
to change Leonard.

22
00:00:50,036 --> 00:00:51,606
(Penny:)That's just what happens
in relationships.

23
00:00:51,771 --> 00:00:53,441
(Penny:)Look how much Amy's changed you.

24
00:00:53,572 --> 00:00:55,612
(Sheldon:)-That's not true.
-Please.

25
00:00:55,775 --> 00:00:57,445
(Penny:)When I first met you,
you were incapable

26
00:00:57,610 --> 00:00:59,020
(Penny:)of touching another human being.

27
00:00:59,078 --> 00:01:01,688
(Penny:)Now you're holding hands,
you're going on dates,

